  MV --> DB["关系库同次提交chunks / indexed / chunk_count"]
  B -->|"异常"| F["EMBEDDING_ERROR / failed / 尝试补偿清理"]
  R -->|"异常"| F
  MV -->|"异常"| VF["VECTOR_ERROR / failed / 尝试补偿清理"]